<title>USA: Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co Q3 $0.22 vs $0.08.</title>
<headline>Littlefield, Adams &amp; Co Q3 $0.22 vs $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	    $   0.22     loss     $  0.08</p>
<p> Net profit		   562     loss	   190</p>
<p> Revs			 2,224		    3,465</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,601		    2,274</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.45     loss	$ 0.12</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,088     loss	   280</p>
<p> Revs			 8,775		   12,898</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,396		    2,274</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the three and nine month periods ending September 30, 1996 includes an extraordinary gain from the extinguishment of debt, which was $94,000, or $0.04 a share after legal costs and income taxes. Included in other income for the third quarter of 1996 are net gains from the sale of assets and litigation settlements of $214,000 and $425,000, respectively. In the third quarter of 1995 there was other income of $366,000, which related to the net gain from the settlement of litigation.</p>
